Project-authored source code, documentation, and self-authored fixtures are
made available under Apache License 2.0 as stated in LICENSE, unless a file
carries an explicit third-party notice.

References to PaddleOCR and PaddlePaddle identify the read-only upstream
behavioral reference used for compatibility research. No PaddleOCR source,
model weights, datasets, fonts, dictionaries, or third-party runtime artifacts
are included in this repository at the time of this notice.

Third-party behavioural references
----------------------------------

`src/contour.rs` is an independent Rust implementation whose observable
behaviour was derived by reading OpenCV's
`modules/imgproc/src/contours.cpp` (`icvFetchContour` and the
`cvFindNextContour` raster scan). That file carries the Intel License
Agreement / BSD 3-clause notice:

    Copyright (C) 2000, Intel Corporation, all rights reserved.
    Third party copyrights are property of their respective owners.

No OpenCV source is copied into this repository. The attribution is recorded
because the algorithm, its direction table, its marking rule, and its contour
ordering were taken from that implementation rather than independently
invented.

